{"meta":{"id":"inheritance","category":"it/syntax/python/class","title":"상속 (ABC · Protocol) · Python","subtitle":"(PYTHON)","summary":"ABC + @abstractmethod, Protocol 구조적 인터페이스, isinstance, 다중 상속","tags":["python","f-class","f-inheritance","f-interface"],"color":"violet","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-violet","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-violet-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-violet-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-violet-50 text-violet-700 border border-violet-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></span>PYTHON</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">상속 (ABC · Protocol) · Python</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-violet-50/70 border border-violet-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-violet-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> ABC + @abstractmethod, Protocol 구조적 인터페이스, isinstance, 다중 상속</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">ABC — 추상 클래스</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">python</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">from abc import ABC, abstractmethod\r\n\r\nclass Shape(ABC):\r\n    def describe(self) -&gt; str:\r\n        return f&quot;넓이 {self.area()}&quot;\r\n\r\n    @abstractmethod\r\n    def area(self) -&gt; float: ...\r\n\r\nclass Circle(Shape):\r\n    def __init__(self, r: float) -&gt; None: self.r = r\r\n    def area(self) -&gt; float: return 3.14 * self.r ** 2\r\n\r\nShape()     # TypeError — 추상 메서드가 있으면 생성 불가 (실행 시점)</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">Protocol — 인터페이스 (구조적 타입)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">python</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">from typing import Protocol\r\n\r\nclass Printable(Protocol):\r\n    def print(self) -&gt; None: ...\r\n\r\nclass Report:                       # 상속 없이 print 만 있으면 Printable\r\n    def print(self) -&gt; None: ...\r\n\r\ndef output(p: Printable) -&gt; None: p.print()\r\n\r\nisinstance(c, Shape)                # 상속 확인 (instanceof)\r\nclass Multi(A, B): ...              # 다중 상속 가능</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › 상속 — TS interface 도 구조적 타입이라 Protocol 과 비슷</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/python/class/inheritance","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"python","title":"PYTHON","path":"it/syntax/python"},{"id":"class","title":"클래스","path":"it/syntax/python/class"}],"hasImage":false}